 "summary": "Gateway profile for the ION7550/ION7650: 227 Analog Inputs, 51 polled by default. Polled values cover currents, frequency, unbalance, phase reversal, voltages, kW, kVAR and kVA per phase and total with maxima, kWh and kVARh delivered/received, kVAh and signed PF; harmonics and other values are unpolled.",
